sequence-diagram

Client [icon: react, color: gray]
API Service [icon: aws-api-gateway, color: blue]
Script Task [icon: aws-fargate, color: green]
Speech Task [icon: aws-fargate, color: green]
S3 [icon: aws-s3, color: yellow]

Client > API Service: Request new Audiobook Job\n(Text File & Webhook URL)
activate API Service
loop [label: Assign Job ID] {
  API Service > API Service: Assign Job ID
}
API Service > S3: Create Job\n(Text File & Job ID)
API Service > Script Task: Request create Script\n(Webhook URL & Job ID)

activate Script Task
Script Task <> S3: Retrieve text file for Job ID
loop [label: Create Script] {
  Script Task > Script Task: Generate Script
}
Script Task > S3: Store script results
Script Task > API Service: POST to webhook\n(Script Job complete)
deactivate Script Task

API Service > Speech Task: Request create Narration\n(Webhook URL & Job ID)
activate Speech Task
Speech Task <> S3: Retrieve script for Job ID
loop [label: Process Job] {
  Speech Task > Speech Task: Process
}
Speech Task > S3: Store Speech results
Speech Task > API Service: POST to webhook\n(Speech Job complete)
deactivate Speech Task

API Service > Client: POST to webhook\n(Audiobook Job complete)
Client > API Service: Request final result
API Service <> S3: Retrieve Narration
API Service > Client: Return Narration

deactivate API Service

